@startuml
title Steam Wrapped - Profile Search and Viewing State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state "Search form ready" as Idle
state "Validating query" as Validating
state "Loading profile" as LoadingProfile
state "Profile result shown" as ProfileLoaded
state "Private profile shown" as PrivateProfile
state "Loading dashboard data" as LoadingDashboard
state "Dashboard shown" as DashboardDisplayed
state "Error shown" as Error

Idle --> Validating : submit form
Validating --> Idle : query is blank
Validating --> LoadingProfile : query is non-blank

LoadingProfile --> ProfileLoaded : public profile returned
LoadingProfile --> PrivateProfile : private profile returned
LoadingProfile --> Error : not found / API error

ProfileLoaded --> LoadingDashboard : select View Wrapped
PrivateProfile --> Idle : edit search
ProfileLoaded --> Idle : edit search

LoadingDashboard --> DashboardDisplayed : profile stats returned
LoadingDashboard --> Error : invalid ID / private games / API error

Error --> Idle : edit search
Error --> LoadingProfile : retry profile search
Error --> LoadingDashboard : retry dashboard request

DashboardDisplayed --> Idle : new search
DashboardDisplayed --> [*] : leave application

@enduml
